# Release formatting policy.  The project intentionally favours readability
# over compactness because filtering policy must be reviewable by operators.
-l=100
-i=4
-ci=4
-ce
-bar
-boc
-boc
-nsfs
-nolq
-wbb="% + - * / x != == >= <= =~ !~ < > | & **= += *= &= <<= &&= -= /= |= >>= ||= //= .= %= ^= x="
